{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>לבקרים</b> — every day, in the manner of one whose practice it is to render judgment in the morning. Some say: for my eyes are upon the faithful of the land to dwell with me in the council of the kingdom; he does not sit the judges. And some say: for he does not sit in the manner of those who sit first, as I have explained."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 101, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:41.947293356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}